    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a84c7ad1827441e181b905c8058b0f0f",
      "statement": "The MotionMatching runtime assembly declares InternalsVisibleTo for its editor assembly, but no internal member is currently read across that boundary — the editor reaches everything it needs through public API and serialized-property lookups.",
