    {
      "id": "claim_bb179f491bae40d090d1577c77574928",
      "statement": "A trajectory feature's prediction frames may be negative, which samples the past rather than the future; MotionMatchingData reports how far the configuration reaches each way as MaximumFramesPrediction and MaximumFramesHistory, each scanning every entry rather than assuming the list is sorted.",
