    {
      "id": "claim_7d9b5cba4fc543dfae72ec94d752b5bb",
      "statement": "The pose velocity feature differences a joint against the next frame within the containing clip, because clips are stored back to back in one array and differencing across a boundary reports the jump cut as joint velocity.",
